invariant: INV-11
file: hkdf.c
catches: unit
reason: hmac_sha256 leaves a key one byte over the block unhashed, and
  RFC 2104 section 2 hashes every key longer than 64 bytes. The 65-byte
  boundary row objects.

--- old
    if (key_len > SHA256_BLOCK) {
--- new
    if (key_len > SHA256_BLOCK + 1) {
